  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.TursoOASIS v2.0.2\n\nConnects the OASIS to Turso (libSQL) via the libSQL HTTP pipeline API. Turso is an edge-native SQLite-compatible database. No SDK required — uses System.Net.Http with JSON pipeline requests. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.1\n- docs(packages): add missing NuGet guides and release setup sections (77c65ea)\n- feat(providers): add PocketBase, Turso, Appwrite, PlanetScale, OrbitDB, and GUN OASIS providers (4a1f3a1)\n- fix: put every project in a solution and fix the bugs that exposed (4612aa0)\n- fix(packaging): explicitly include newly documented package readmes (5be30be)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Cloud/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.TursoOASIS",
